"""Generated protobuf + gRPC bindings for `proto/workflow.proto`.

**Do not edit by hand.** Regenerate with `make proto` after changing the
`.proto`; the checked-in output is what makes `uv sync && make run` work without
a codegen step (Python has no `build.rs`, so the alternative is a build everyone
has to remember). `pyproject.toml` excludes this package from ruff and pyright
for the same reason: it is machine-written. Callers still get full types — the
`.pyi` files beside each module come from `mypy-protobuf`.
"""
